// tasks: what the counter makes you do (Queue, Form, Stamp, Photocopy, Theory).
// weights: overrides for obstacles.ron. opens_day: front door locked before that day.
// Dialog for each office lives in dialog/<id>.ron. "issued.<doc>" overrides "issued" for one document.
